1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,180
There's another on my right forearm, and it's got a story too

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:07,460
Tried to lift a load by myself, should have been a job for two

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:11,540
My bicep tore loose and rolled up in my armpit like a window shade

4
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:14,820
So they opened up my arm and tied it back, and that's the scar it made

5
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:18,900
That was my pride's receipt, and brother, it was paid in full

6
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:22,500
So now I ask for an extra set of hands before I pull

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,180
Some scars teach you what you're made of, some teach you what you're not

8
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:30,180
And the smartest thing I ever learned came from the stubborn one I've got

9
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,860
Let it close, let it mend

10
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,780
Let the stitches do their work

11
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,620
It's okay to heal

12
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,140
Even though it hurts

13
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:39,670
So embrace every scar

14
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:43,780
It shows who you are

15
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:46,500
Every line's a road you walked

16
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:48,180
Every mark says how far

17
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,860
Wear 'em out in the open

18
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:54,980
Let 'em see what you survived

19
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:57,460
'Cause the pain is just proof, yeah

20
00:00:57,460 --> 00:01:08,260
The pain is just proof you're alive
